{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在解释人物行为动机上略逊于X，尤其S02没有充分交代他为什么要提醒自己受过的气，S11也弱化了暂缓回去、先稳定眼下生活的具体理由。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点句有明确的视觉落点，扫一眼就能抓住每段人物心理的变化，而且感受词随音乐节点出现，不必在有限时间里同时处理整堆文字。它对音乐细节、情绪转折和身体感受的描写也更具体，尤其能让人感到柔软、焦躁、失重、疲惫和重新站稳之间的细微差别。X的优势是人物行为背后的因果解释更完整，但综合观看体验，Y更容易让普通观众既跟上故事，又听见音乐中的细节。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "190dc581-ae49-4104-9f4a-ae81bde5dbd7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T212556509138Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:26:45.411117+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5377e6832bf54a26047333ed6a97f66046bcdf337ae4256435395181576b6fe2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_